        <li>City of Biloxi — <a href="https://biloxi.ms.us" target="_blank" rel="noopener">biloxi.ms.us</a></li>
        <li>Coastal Mississippi (visitor info) — <a href="https://www.coastalmississippi.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">coastalmississippi.com</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sources-note"><strong>Verified May 2026.</strong> Transit routes, parking, and resort details change — confirm current information with the city or venue before counting on it.</p>
    </aside>

  </main>

